    "en": {
      "name": "Ghostrick Garden",
      "effect": "Once while face-up on the field, during your Main Phase: You can add 1 \"Ghostrick\" monster from your Deck to your hand. If a monster(s) is sent to the GY by an opponent's card effect (except during the Damage Step): You can activate 1 of these effects;\n\u25cf Change 1 face-up or face-down \"Ghostrick\" monster you control to face-up or face-down Defense Position.\n\u25cf Attach the top card of your Deck to 1 \"Ghostrick\" Xyz Monster you control.\nYou can only activate 1 \"Ghostrick Garden\" per turn.",
      "official": false
    },
